{"id":1507,"title":"Python支持多重继承吗？","summary":"Python支持多重继承吗？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"071e8ffb-a75a-3f94-b858-c4ed02392973","knowledge_id":189,"title":"Python支持多重继承吗？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":189,"title":"Python支持多重继承吗？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"be52c978-bb8d-3786-9658-e89f665a4b2d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"Python 支持多重继承，一个类同时继承自多个类。\n\n请看这个例子：","text_html":"<p>Python 支持多重继承，一个类同时继承自多个类。</p>\n<p>请看这个例子：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ee9eb2ba-6c75-3113-9900-64d8d544eb1c","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"class Person:\n    def can_walk(self):\n        print('person can walk')\n        \nclass Student:\n    def can_study(self):\n        print('Student can study')\n        \n\n# Boy类同时继承自Person和Student类\nclass Boy(Person, Student):\n    pass\n\n\nb = Boy()\n# 调用继承自Person类的方法\nb.can_walk()\n\n# 调用继承自Student类的方法\nb.can_study()","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d5488f60-eb3e-3c7f-8734-3a410dadf2f5","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这个示例中，`Person` 和`Student` 是两个独立的类。但 `Boy` 类同时继承自 `Person` 和 `Student` 类。","text_html":"<p>在这个示例中，<code>Person</code> 和<code>Student</code> 是两个独立的类。但 <code>Boy</code> 类同时继承自 <code>Person</code> 和 <code>Student</code> 类。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/